# UniformDisc(a, b) draws from a..b-1, the upper end excluded (Diabolo's reading: its
# benchmarks draw a fair die as UniformDisc(1, 7)). UniformDisc(0, 2) is a fair coin on
# {0, 1} with mean 1/2, so this upper bound holds.
# Expected: valid. Read with b included, the draw was uniform on {0, 1, 2} with mean 1,
# and the bound did not hold.
x ~ UniformDisc(0, 2);
return x
?Ex[x] <= 0.5
